{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24825","headline":"太常观阅骠国新乐 · 胡直钧","name":"太常观阅骠国新乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"异音来骠国，初被奉常人。\n才可宫商辨，殊惊节奏新。\n转规回绣面，曲折度文身。\n舒散随鸾吹，喧呼杂鸟春。\n襟袵怀旧识，丝竹变恒陈。\n何事留中夏，长令表化淳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡直钧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24825.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24825","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}